									<div class="elementor-testimonial">
							<div class="elementor-testimonial__content">
					<div class="elementor-testimonial__text">
						First of all I would like to mention Dr. Naineshwari who took her time &amp; explained every single detail of my teeth 🦷!!
My teeth wasn’t aligned &amp; my wisdom teeth were tilt &amp; baby tooth didn’t had enough space to get out 😪
But Dr. Naineshwari made me realize not to worry about &amp; go for the treatment &amp; promised for the best smile😀 Ofcourse with aligned teeth😄
Secondly, I would like to mention the owner &amp; the Dentist with 27 years of experience Dr.Anand Jasani very calm, very kind &amp; make us feel comfortable &amp; of course the expert😃 He himself promised as well to give Me the best teeth &amp; Beautiful smile as well😌
Then, I would like to mention about Dr. Meera who did my treatment from start till end💕
She was very light handed &amp; truly amazing Doc who took care of me very well even though it was painful she didn’t even let me feel like anything 🥰
Then, I would also like to mention all the assistants name Kajal, Ranjan, Nandini, Kinjal they were super duper sweet, nice, caring &amp; helpful regarding your treatment they make you comfortable by providing you liquids if you can’t take it by yourself because of anesthesia 🤓
Sorry if I forgot to mention any name about staff &amp; yes cashier at the entrance are very welcoming &amp; respectful as well no matter how old are you🫠
Overall I had an amazing experience &amp; smooth treatment from start till end☺️
I would totally recommend City Dental Hospital for the best Dental treatment.					</div>
